---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<Layout title="Contact — Trainory" description="Get in touch about Trainory: bug reports, feature ideas, questions about your data, or help with your account. Email goes to the developer.">
  <article class="prose-page">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>{SITE.name} is run by one person, {SITE.creator}. Email is the fastest way to reach me.</p>
    <p><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="btn btn-primary btn-pill !text-on-primary !no-underline">Email {SITE.email}</a></p>

    <h2>Good reasons to write</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Something is broken or a number looks wrong.</li>
      <li>You want a feature, or an exercise or food added to the starter plan.</li>
      <li>You want your account closed and your sign-in record removed.</li>
      <li>You have a question about the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> or the <a href="/terms/">terms</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Please include the email address you signed up with and, for bugs, what you were doing when it happened.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
